    "research_notes": {
      "limitations": [
        "Coverage concentrates on children, families and social-protection design; it is not an exhaustive account of vulnerability across the life course.",
        "Institutional programme descriptions establish stated activities and concerns, not independently evaluated effectiveness.",
        "The social-protection brief is dated December 2022; the source does not specify a publication day.",
        "Undated programme pages were accessed after the cutoff and may have changed."
      ],
      "unverified_items": [
        "Current benefit eligibility, adequacy and exclusion rates through October 2026.",
        "Recent independent evidence concerning older people, homelessness, substance-use-related risks and long-term care.",
